  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 36 * 16 * 4 * 20 * 90 * 46\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) ×, ÷ , + , – , = \n\n36 * 16 * 4 * 20 * 90 * 46 ⇒ 36 × 16 ÷ 4 + 20 - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ 36 × __**16 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 20 - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ __**36 × 4**__ + 20 - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ __**144**____** + 20**__ - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ __**164**____** - 90**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 74 ≠ 46 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + , ÷ ,×, – , =\n\n36 * 16 * 4 * 20 * 90 * 46 ⇒ 36 + 16 ÷ 4 × 20 - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ 36 + __**16 **____**÷**____** 4**__ × 20 - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ 36 + __**4**____** ×**____** 20**__ - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ __**36 + 8**____**0**__ - 90 = 46\n\n⇒ __**116**____** - 90**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 26 ≠ 46 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) – , ÷ , + , ×, =\n\n36 * 16 * 4 * 20 * 90 * 46 ⇒ 36 - 16 ÷ 4 + 20 × 90 = 46\n\n⇒ 36 - __**16 **____**÷**____** 4**__ + 20 × 90 = 46\n\n⇒ 36 - 4 + __**20 **____**×**____** 90**__ = 46\n\n⇒ __**36 + 1800**__ - 4 = 46\n\n⇒ __1836** - 4**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 1832 ≠ 46 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) – , ÷ , ×, + , =\n\n36 * 16 * 4 * 20 * 90 * 46 ⇒ 36 - 16 ÷ 4 × 20 + 90 = 46\n\n⇒ 36 - __**16 **____**÷**____** 4**__ × 20 + 90 = 46\n\n⇒ 36 - __**4**____** ×**____** 20**__ + 90 = 46\n\n⇒ __**36 + 90**__ - 80 = 46\n\n⇒ __126** - 80**__ = 46\n\n⇒ 46 = 46 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
